    "actions": [],
    "description": "<p>The SGRD-Gd9hp “Godhand” Powered Armor is truly heavy and bulky powered armor, providing greater strength, protection, and potential storage. Equipped with considerable life support and environmental protection, making the bearer a borderline heavy tank all by themselves.</p><p>Grants notable resilience to all types of damage, particularly Physical and ranged weapon damage, grants +15 Base ATK, and +20 DEF and SPDEF, increases the Physical damage the user deals, reduces the user's SPD by -35%, provides +20% RES, and grants +4 Belt Slots.</p><p>As well, whenver the user is hit by a Critical Hit, they are @Affliction[delay 40], have a 30% chance of losing @Tick[-1], and have a 70% chance of losing -1 ATK and SPD Stages for 3 Activations.</p>",
